# Placeholder for leak-detector.usdz
# In a production environment, this would be a USDZ model file for iOS Quick Look AR
# You can create or convert a glTF model to USDZ format

To add a real USDZ model:
1. Create a 3D model in glTF format
2. Convert it to USDZ using Apple's Reality Converter or online tools
3. Replace this file with the actual .usdz file
4. iOS devices will be able to view it in AR using Quick Look

Conversion tools:
- Reality Converter (Apple, macOS only)
- Online converters (search for "glTF to USDZ converter")
- Blender with USDZ export plugins
